(10, 1, 'assistant', 'I\'m back and ready to assist you.\n\nYou want me to update the draft post to reflect that applicants should register on the admissions page of the HQ site, rather than the official University of Ibadan website. Here\'s the updated draft post:\n\n**Title:** University of Ibadan Post UTME Form Now Available!\n\n**Short Summary:** The University of Ibadan has announced that the Post UTME form is now available. Don\'t miss this opportunity to secure your spot in the university! Register now on our admissions page.\n\n**Main Post:**\n\nThe University of Ibadan has officially announced that the Post UTME form is now available. This is a great opportunity for students who have been searching for a chance to secure their spot in the university.\n\nTo register for the Post UTME form, please visit our admissions page on the HQ site. Our admissions team will guide you through the registration process and ensure that you have a smooth experience.\n\n**Important Details:**\n\n* The Post UTME form is now available.\n* Interested candidates can register on our admissions page.\n* Our admissions team will be available to assist with any questions or concerns.\n\n**Suggested CTA:** Register now for the Post UTME form on our admissions page and take the first step towards achieving your academic goals!\n\n**Suggested Tags:** University of Ibadan, Post UTME, Admission, Academic Success, Opportunity\n\nHere\'s the updated draft post in JSON format, which I\'ll propose to be added to the Review Queue:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"propose_action\",\n  \"action_type\": \"insert\",\n  \"target_table\": \"posts\",\n  \"impact\": \"light\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"title\": \"University of Ibadan Post UTME Form Now Available!\",\n    \"content\": \"The University of Ibadan has officially announced that the Post UTME form is now available. This is a great opportunity for students who have been searching for a chance to secure their spot in the university.\\n\\nTo register for the Post UTME form, please visit our admissions page on the HQ site. Our admissions team will guide you through the registration process and ensure that you have a smooth experience.\\n\\n**Important Details:**\\n* The Post UTME form is now available.\\n* Interested candidates can register on our admissions page.\\n* Our admissions team will be available to assist with any questions or concerns.\\n\\nRegister now for the Post UTME form on our admissions page and take the first step towards achieving your academic goals!\",\n    \"tags\": \"University of Ibadan, Post UTME, Admission, Academic Success, Opportunity\"\n  },\n  \"reason\": \"Drafting a new post as requested.\"\n}\n```\n\nI\'ve proposed this action to be added to the Review Queue with an impact level of \"light\" since it\'s a new post draft. Please review and confirm before it\'s published.', '2026-07-14 16:53:43'),
