(1194, 3, 'Which option correctly matches the term \'adaptation\' with its meaning?', 'The correct match is adaptation: an inherited feature that improves an organism\'s chance of survival and reproduction.', 'mixed', 'HQ-JAMB-BIOLOGY-CD0654C613', 1, NULL, '2026-06-23 18:12:42', '2026-06-23 18:21:32'),
