(1196, 3, 'Which option correctly matches the term \'homeostasis\' with its meaning?', 'The correct match is homeostasis: the maintenance of a relatively stable internal environment in an organism.', 'mixed', 'HQ-JAMB-BIOLOGY-36F1305300', 1, NULL, '2026-06-23 18:12:42', '2026-06-23 18:21:32'),
