(1204, 3, 'Which option correctly matches the term \'vein\' with its meaning?', 'The correct match is vein: a blood vessel that carries blood toward the heart.', 'mixed', 'HQ-JAMB-BIOLOGY-74BAE71768', 1, NULL, '2026-06-23 18:12:42', '2026-06-23 18:21:32'),
