(1305, 6, 'Which option correctly matches the term \'national income\' with its meaning?', 'The correct match is national income: the total income earned from the production of goods and services in an economy over a period.', 'mixed', 'HQ-JAMB-ECONOMICS-A5FA91D0B0', 1, NULL, '2026-06-23 18:12:42', '2026-06-23 18:21:32'),
