(1316, 6, 'Which option correctly matches the term \'monetary policy\' with its meaning?', 'The correct match is monetary policy: central bank action to influence money supply, interest rates and credit conditions.', 'mixed', 'HQ-JAMB-ECONOMICS-6A51361A72', 1, NULL, '2026-06-23 18:12:42', '2026-06-23 18:21:32'),
