(1318, 6, 'Which option correctly matches the term \'direct tax\' with its meaning?', 'The correct match is direct tax: a tax imposed directly on the income or wealth of the person who bears it.', 'mixed', 'HQ-JAMB-ECONOMICS-886FCF917E', 1, NULL, '2026-06-23 18:12:42', '2026-06-23 18:21:32'),
